  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">D02652 Global Forum on Transparency and Exchange of Information for Tax Purposes</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Forum on Transparency and Exchange of Information for Tax Purposes - Regional and International Tax Initiatives (RITI) Project seeks to support developing countries raise domestic revenue in a way that in turn drives inclusive growth and development. It will help developing countries benefit from global best practice and take a more active role in the design of international tax standards.</narrative>
  </description>
